mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nlead-magnets-and-funnels is the **offer-design layer** of the monetization cluster — it designs the\nmagnet the capture paths deliver and the whole social→capture→nurture funnel that ties the cluster\ntogether. The agent **designs + drafts**; **WoopSocial has no landing/form/email/quiz builder** — it\npublishes the **promo posts**; capture/delivery/nurture run in **external tools**.\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **WoopSocial has no landing-page / form / quiz / email-automation builder.** Those are **external**\n  (landing/quiz builders + an ESP), **human-set-up.** The agent **designs the magnet + full funnel** and\n  **drafts** the nurture sequence, landing copy, and promo posts; **WoopSocial publishes the promo/trigger\n  posts** that drive signups.\n- **Metrics from the external tools + GA4** (signups/clicks/conversions) — **never fabricate** a number or\n  fake social proof.\n- **Real value, no dark patterns** — no bait-and-switch \"magnets,\" **no fake/resetting urgency**, **visible\n  unsubscribe**, **clear (un-prechecked) consent** (**GDPR / CAN-SPAM / FTC**). Value-first nurture; don't\n  pitch early.\n- **Magnet must connect to the paid offer** (or, if there's no offer yet, it's audience-building — keep it\n  light). **No bought lists.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **lead-magnets-and-funnels (this)** — **designs the magnet + the social→capture→nurture funnel.**\n- **link-in-bio-and-traffic** / **social-selling-and-dm** — the **capture PATHS** (bio link / DM) that\n  **deliver** the magnet.\n- **email-and-newsletter** — the **owned channel / ongoing nurture** the funnel feeds into (the ESP-side\n  relationship).\n- **goals-and-kpis** — sets the conversion target the funnel serves; **analytics-and-reporting** measures it.\n- **content-calendar**/**campaign-and-launch-planning** — schedule the promo push.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (audience/offer), `goals-and-kpis` (the conversion goal).\n- **Magnet creative:** `image-prompt`/`ideogram`/`nano-banana` (covers/visuals), `carousel-writer` (a carousel\n  magnet), `caption-writer`/`hook-writer` (promo + landing copy), `story-writer` (Story promo).\n- **Capture paths (deliver the magnet):** `link-in-bio-and-traffic`, `social-selling-and-dm`.\n- **Nurture / owned channel:** `email-and-newsletter` (the 3–5 sequence lives + runs here, in the ESP).\n- **Promote + publish:** `content-calendar`, `campaign-and-launch-planning`, `scheduling-and-queue →\n  WoopSocial` (promo posts only).\n- **Measure/test:** `analytics-and-reporting` (external-tool/GA4 readout), `goals-and-kpis`,\n  `experimentation-and-ab-testing` (A/B the magnet, landing, subject lines). **The funnel itself runs in external tools.**\n"
